<title>UK: Deutsche unit sets $250 mln Dec 1998 bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche unit sets $250 mln Dec 1998 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE BANK FINANCE NV (CURACAO)</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DEUTSCHE BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    23.DEC.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.932   PAY DATE    23.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     REOFFER    99.932    SPREAD	FLAT</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NA/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    =	   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  A.00	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
